  "body": "## What changed\n\nAdd a toolpath schematic to each of the 44 operation reference sections.\nGive each image descriptive alternative text.\nKeep all pictures in one SVG asset with named views.\nAdd a legend to each family page.\nRecord the choice in docs/decisions/1250-operation-pictures.md.\n\n## Cause\n\nEarlier PRs added the operation reference pages without path pictures.\nThe pages did not show the typical path for each operation kind.\n\n## Tests\n\nRun `python3 site/tests/test_operation_reference.py`.\nBoth tests pass: `test_every_operation_has_section_and_picture` and `test_picture_views_are_valid_and_described`.\nThe tests failed before the fix for all 44 missing pictures and the missing asset.\nRestore each of the seven original pages from upstream/main: the coverage test fails for that family.\nRestore the fixed page after each mutation: both tests pass.\nRemove the SVG asset: the asset test fails.\nChange a view origin or remove its drawn path: the asset test fails.\nRestore each change: both tests pass.\n`cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` passes with zero selected Rust steps.\nClippy does not apply because this PR changes no Rust crate.\n`git diff --check` passes.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nNone. No NC or CL file changes.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nZola build and link checks did not run because Zola is not installed.\nThe browser preview could not start because libnspr4.so is missing.\nXML and view structure checks pass. Browser rendering still needs a check.\nThe pictures are schematics without scale. They are not generated NC paths.\nNo machine run or path generation changed.\n\n## Overlaps\n\nNone. The file checks found no open PR that changes these files.\nThis branch starts at upstream/main, dc44993f.\n\nEffort: high\n\nChangelog: Add toolpath pictures for all 44 operation reference sections.\n\nFixes #1250\n",
